      "hash": "4def77f9388809f53620144510fcc4b6f08662617bcc06a15abc618242e6544c"
    },
    {
      "id": "b66326d798b97a6dedac6423859cd930101f4781095b84d0c788ae38d7b3b598",
      "text": "Topics",
      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "3b922d26bdc34d9d6f11ab4863597c49ffeedffa872bea66536ae0c1411789a2",
      "text": "Patterns of Work",
      "hash": "451912cbee5f0ec6ab7874916ee61c5d7d98c7c960493b524130e6c14b3e3f92"
    },
    {
      "id": "2bd24a4c88123e1bdd6fec1e5c69308bf047704b7c2adec682f443526b34a8f7",
      "text": "Automated review",
      "hash": "df3514233adbdec46b793e0c605f72423cd52386b0c05dcd3d604d6f196da301"
    },
    {
      "id": "7a0870c014d2b097b050dfdcf80b0f0bbf8ecd7a15f46fab646adf06f8b1940d",
      "text": "An agent reviewing another agent's work, often with a different model or system prompt. Non-deterministic: it forms a judgement.",
      "hash": "7bd47568e0d2439ecdb054618692172c3e467f262ee7e7e71666aa9c752041a8"
    },
    {
      "id": "ff9a014e6437eb8d9e3c8f204095f3c22123ec9f3e36a7909732748381365f93",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "7f08f0d2685f12b9eed0781e50a5c6177b7d3b1f650ef28064b0cc912a70f7ad",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad9a7c1adaa39de3e4ce7dce05d2055bb3bca893986e1af9cf03d8a96207053",
      "text": "An",
      "hash": "9f98b7c7f071714517d9a5e67c135b41fa3e91f20bac108158b33b073396f6e5"
    },
    {
      "id": "681d544ade98f77dff96e61f02d4282286cf8ee82da24f0081e87e21be66e5cf",
      "text": "reviewing another agent's work, often with a different",
      "hash": "37abc1c3ac3a66b35d64dd5eebab8e004f9b78ad9e6debe32c30958896a6a483"
    },
    {
      "id": "ce5adc06c26ab45a76a667e93d1d24a286e535fd376cc36fd95ef087853b3dc2",
      "text": "system prompt",
      "hash": "e16202309c92180728dd7fd1c59f16004a6d5ee245538c28d2a9a22edf2dd2ab"
    },
    {
      "id": "6847966725dae2688807dbd335c6829a7ab9a7343493306607a944938de03cc4",
      "text": ". Non-deterministic: it forms a judgement. Runs anywhere — pre-merge on a PR, post-hoc on commit history, mid-session as a",
      "hash": "1917d5cb322680db9bd814dd75ed0fd52bdeb8a9e605032edc06a641193cb071"
    },
    {
      "id": "830ef0718d2e5ce27330cee57f3c11e5ef027487263cac42b7b63ba3371474d3",
      "text": ". An LLM-as-judge in CI is automated review, not an",
      "hash": "b3d727795937565daf1d81cef7f50259fb9c9a2b273d57305d99c662acb8dc75"
    },
    {
      "id": "9a4dc23a0e6712209731e3bc5eb5ef57c3062b11d5823eebe7336c1459522a80",
      "text": "automated check",
      "hash": "5dbcde95643b056df8fea05ec92c509b9bfb0a81b602d709ca50f14545835248"
    },
    {
      "id": "32eacdccb63ac8e8737a6f54ebc4bd510b086eeefc5947d8452f130ded1acff9",
      "text": "; what the assertion",
      "hash": "1df0bb3b5295eae85e9a565008847222ff73d44abc11db6ccdc9d806bc44de17"
    },
    {
      "id": "d5e4ebc76d39d1a28d52c4b18f7130b8b828e6fd39a85dce1c640c81d78fad3a",
      "text": "decides the category, not where it runs.",
      "hash": "42b989c5c293830bcc8aaa260d3a2eeaafcbd4fa0f8029ce2b112ceb17e41f4f"
    },
    {
      "id": "7a0a9317f140be004c8e5366805221f2fe1284b068d6323653ff5a320a4ebd48",
      "text": "The separation from the working agent is what makes it work. Asking the agent that wrote the code to review its own work gets you very little — the",
      "hash": "0352d2b73f46cab79ce2e0a771ec1fbc81272b23e2ca08b2b238d4adb082e587"
    },
    {
      "id": "adf7a753f7ad61890b57d4f44178a7d51450b23bc5523dd4674046e3daba3c40",
      "text": "that produced the bug also contains the reasoning that produced it, and the agent reads its own conclusions back as confirmation. A reviewer with a fresh",
      "hash": "1f4ba5e7e3cbfe0e2bd8423bec1c61e47ef7465be74afe31347f55f6949fb1c9"
    },
    {
      "id": "f467861d50ac43723d370927fe2cfd11421e8d7554e55c89d1ff05be928d2bf6",
      "text": "context window",
      "hash": "6764434518d37f01df452fe2af0af3f314f8c27a72519001ea14189c5ee42476"
    },
    {
      "id": "ce687bc1275ff68c09aa2b781c41271ea563a138d1091d38a698a7c21d6946a8",
      "text": "has none of that attachment: it sees the diff the way a stranger would, which is what review depends on. A different model or a review-specific system prompt sharpens this further — different blind spots, and a system prompt scoped to what you actually care about (security, API contracts, performance) rather than a vague \"look for problems\".",
      "hash": "5d96d83b2b9be720478b4a952735c8529855d94e64d9711e6317fa33b3bb8089"
    },
    {
      "id": "5aa2e70481611c406db5720a0f9d49bf008901d5c3c48ea62849bdb3a930bc6e",
      "text": "It slots between the other review layers. Automated checks are deterministic and catch what can be asserted mechanically;",
      "hash": "d9f9b7623a526920e51ec345ae4b101f2497a053d2dbde8380ac28d5179de1e2"
    },
    {
      "id": "de1821f274574fc541a230ba08d0be22afb61531fb295368f0c58914aabd414a",
      "text": "human review",
      "hash": "978a8b09ee5844e15ea0661d83702e00e6b4312de7dae44479adf0e8d7f5262b"
    },
    {
      "id": "d2d8a93f4506201ceb1f639743e91b14eb34d5245025ce5c3a1aeeff00eefd5f",
      "text": "is expensive and scales worst. Automated review sits in the middle: it catches judgement-shaped problems — a misleading function name, a missed edge case — at machine cost. Because it's non-deterministic, it can miss things and flag non-issues; treat it as a filter that raises the floor before a human looks, not a gate that replaces one.",
      "hash": "21514ef9c34ebc097f97f00c79d28df5bdc29d8936b6d556d151bf571924d5cd"
    },
    {
      "id": "68f5d65b8c8628195cf4d29f700e68be3b5e0969a5bebe0911cc55d86eb22a1b",
      "text": "Avoid:",
      "hash": "0c98d3dd1920fdb71269240ba1ce3a7323099760ecd0b295f071aca6b07e30df"
    },
    {
      "id": "532ed064ea78a6fdc4e089310d963c66537606521b4b3128a7ab876f3ae49746",
      "text": "\"AI review\" / \"agent review\" — too vague to distinguish from the working agent itself.",
      "hash": "e2175acaa12b1b9ad5ad31b7ede9ab4849bcbe9a64b62b73b28124c09d2ca315"
    },
    {
      "id": "fbe8edf8e4ee2540c3f90840796321f8aca0379b2f82bb3a0a5c805262587750",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "2f8c622d7eb5813f2b9d08eafbe13b16baf68ed802fabf3e83a69f34205774e8",
      "text": "\"We're getting too many bad PRs from the",
      "hash": "bba90f488cee9629183a7e6538fe7edfd7946d0feead1fb5c8fa84a0ee29480d"
    },
    {
      "id": "fd9a911d6e26157d0dc89fc8290d2076ff9348fb54c44e7d4226e946afeb2961",
      "text": "AFK",
      "hash": "875e0577157f743e3346ba95f1d944d08e54b3cab40d89819dff5f48cd507392"
    },
    {
      "id": "7027ca3a312e041bf957c86deb8a6b8edf1885335c62a6228d0b17944ca10e22",
      "text": "runs.\"",
      "hash": "125ead921f69ffbcf6158494ce19d407f25cc6e2bd818037e3b14090c9d08e49"
    },
    {
      "id": "f7e989e5057417c53f2d81e36ce020ae87ab39314bf2817961a204ab979fd7d0",
      "text": "\"Add an automated review step before merge — different model, separate system prompt, scoped to security and contract changes.\"",
      "hash": "1db0d2591e5f01bc9c70e80fc6ee23371d27b5ab2c886bbc13dead6c2cd5c646"
    },
    {
      "id": "f9a7960b915910855c80f304abe5bbad34aff4e1b2f3ac5e89dd1ac2e32e5f81",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "964617b884fc234b58268c5cb13814bacd47537a38b4cce7ee932aef1f35d0e0",
      "text": "Automated check",
      "hash": "02f50ca3b316125cc24382d78e247a47971a48880f6655c3cfcfcd84dc3891e9"
    },
    {
      "id": "47572b25f19110ff26807aae92e5e71dba4e7d0fbe826962442926ced4589082",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "52b4e54bdc1732200578e2304297e00f922dcbc67ea4435730e9b554f867e0ee",
      "text": "Human review",
      "hash": "c1f43b8fad7537eba5cc87664a03cf3efedf7b64fb1d45ffa16a81d566ea2cb3"
    },
    {
      "id": "1b22c86cb589fa48413b2d87bf0d1d33e53606d0369604da6e260c221cd5eae9",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
    },
    {
      "id": "d627440ad7c1d141afd3058910dc86a746986c2304866424a869ab324cfcf11d",
      "text": "Join AI Hero for practical skills, thinking on AI engineering, and resources that keep you ahead of the curve.",
      "hash": "a082f7147e30da6afe92268d5668a530edfff13e64934f8f63f22c098db86133"
    },
    {
      "id": "f82eaa20486f4b98ecfb1aceb5a6fec3cb4cd832db09a4b8c483f4fb36dffd9a",
